 "result": "In `src/tessel/helpers.py:360-399`, `get_flashed_messages` filters with the `category_filter` argument.\n\n- If `category_filter` is non-empty, it keeps only the `(category, message)` tuples whose category is in the filter: `filter(lambda f: f[0] in category_filter, flashes)` (line 396).\n- `with_categories` is separate: it only controls the return shape, bare messages by default or `(category, message)` tuples if `True`.\n- The flashes are popped from the session once per request and cached on `app_ctx._flashes`, so repeated calls in the same request return the same messages. The filter is applied to that cached list each time.",
